## Claude Desktop Buddy protocol compatibility

This project implements compatibility with the public Hardware Buddy BLE wire protocol
documented by Anthropic in [`anthropics/claude-desktop-buddy`](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-desktop-buddy).

The FoloToy-Card implementation was written against that public protocol reference using
ESP-IDF APIs. No source code, character art, GIF, or other artwork from the upstream
repository was copied or adapted. The repository's existing licensing situation is
unchanged; this notice does not add an upstream license to the FoloToy-Card source.

